#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:143
msgid "Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems (Erle-Brain 2)"
msgstr "兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:5
#: afb73d61732a48aca6dd026b199f90d1
msgid "Archived Topic: Erle-Brain2 Wiring Quick Start"
msgstr "已归档主题：Erle-Brain2 接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:7
#: 242871ae7513437585b9de706c3b53f7
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to power :ref:`Erle-"
"Brain2 <common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot>` and connect its most important "
"peripherals."
msgstr ""
"本文提供了如何为 :ref:`Erle-Brain2 <common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot>` "
"供电并连接其最重要外设的高层次说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:15
#: 61f04a6d25b840b281d1e9c415a34d93
msgid "Erle-Brain2 Wiring Chart"
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:23
#: f2be033ff5e04248a96fa2026709815b
msgid "Power Erle-Brain2"
msgstr "为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:25
#: 5a3328e87adc4083abf63ef062372813
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the "
"picture below. The power port simultaneously powers Erle-Brain2 and reads "
"voltage and current analog measurements."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 通常通过其「电源」接口供电，如下图所示。电源接口同时为 Erle-Brain2 供电并读取电压和电流模拟量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:32
#: 792e5ba245244d4cab3b13d92f0788ec
msgid ""
"Additionally, for developing/configuration purposes, it can be powered using"
" a micro USB charger (2A recommended), as shown in the below picture."
msgstr "此外，出于开发/配置目的，也可使用 Micro USB 充电器（推荐 2A）供电，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:41
#: e6a29c7a3ede4a898d3708a6f731cb74
msgid "Always use a power module to feed Erle-Brain2 while flying your drone"
msgstr "飞行无人机时，请始终使用电源模块为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:45
#: b9e7ff231f30479eaadb64c06a5cc697
msgid "Connect remote control inputs"
msgstr "连接遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:47
#: 65ca78d4040d4ff9a1b2b06c78a42138
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
msgstr ""
"Erle-Brain2 兼容 PPM 遥控（RC）接收机。对于传统的单线每通道（PWM）接收机，可使用 PPM 编码器将接收机输出转换为 PPM-SUM"
" 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:51
#: b7694509f5934a49b2a36bc5bbeb08f1
msgid ""
"For more information see :ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver "
"Systems (Erle-Brain 2) <common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-"
"systems-erle-brain-2>`."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 :ref:`兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）<common-compatible-rc-transmitter-"
"and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:56
#: 6ae00cd19820443f9a6ef94e457fd1da
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:59
#: a23896ff78524f618c1095d368761919
msgid "GPS+Compass"
msgstr "GPS+罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:61
#: a3538f3daf064170b0571a3590aafb15
msgid ""
"The `uBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-"
"compass-kit/>`__ is the recommended GPS for Erle-Brain2. The GPS port is "
"connected with the six-position DF13 cable, and the Compass port is "
"connected to the I2C port with the four-position DF13 cable, as shown in the"
" :ref:`wiring chart above <common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start_erle-"
"brain2_wiring_chart>`."
msgstr ""
"`uBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-"
"neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ 是 Erle-Brain2 推荐使用的 GPS。GPS 接口使用六针 DF13 "
"线缆连接，罗盘接口使用四针 DF13 线缆连接到 I2C 接口，如 :ref:`上方接线图 <common-erle-brain2-wiring-"
"quick-start_erle-brain2_wiring_chart>` 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:68
#: ce6df8ef6ed9401786175c553cfc7da8
msgid "Connect Motors"
msgstr "连接电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:75
#: 2e99209d54094169a3cdc455256a4de2
msgid ""
"Be aware of how you connect ESCs wires to PWM rail. The signal wire (white "
"or orange color) should be connected at the top, the ground wire (black or "
"brown color) at the bottom."
msgstr "注意电调线缆连接到 PWM 总线的方式。信号线（白色或橙色）应连接在上方，地线（黑色或棕色）应连接在下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:83
#: b5516b6b981a4b6789a02c5813657510
msgid ""
"For planes connect the control channel wires to the main output signal pins:"
msgstr "对于固定翼飞机，请将控制通道线接到主输出信号引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:86
#: 9f84d89315354321b69437b50e94ce17
msgid "Pin 1 = Aileron"
msgstr "引脚 1 = 副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:87
#: b3f1360c1b96438fb800c3a0cbc7bcb7
msgid "Pin 2 = Elevator"
msgstr "引脚 2 = 升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:88
#: 5d46c9b64e8a4f65bc4edba315c311fa
msgid "Pin 3 = Throttle"
msgstr "引脚 3 = 油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:89
#: 4cf77f4746234020ab37a25d543480e7
msgid "Pin 4 = Rudder"
msgstr "引脚 4 = 方向舵"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:96
#: f090cb78446a489fb497748a7520a224
msgid "USB ports"
msgstr "USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:98
#: bf948263aacd4d65b6e785ed5e8767ce
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 has four USB ports. Some of the devices you can connect are "
"listed in the following section."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 有四个 USB 接口。以下部分列出了一些可连接的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:102
#: ac65f5aecf6140638780b71454a4d3d4
msgid "WiFi dongle"
msgstr "WiFi 接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:104
#: cf62a6d2876a438faaa68e537426818d
msgid ""
"Use a (regular or high gain) WiFi dongle to create a hotspot that can, for "
"example, be used for sending telemetry data and commands to a Ground "
"Station. Erle-Brain2 automatically generates a WiFi hotspot when the dongle "
"is connected."
msgstr ""
"使用（普通或高增益）WiFi 接收器创建热点，例如用于向地面站发送数传数据和指令。当接收器连接后，Erle-Brain2 会自动生成 WiFi 热点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:111
#: a3c5f19bdcf341f9bd44ce820159da10
msgid ""
"Edimax AC (regular and high gain) are the officially supported dongles. "
"These can be purchased from Erle-Brain with your autopilot/vehicle."
msgstr "Edimax AC（普通和高增益）是官方支持的接收器。可随飞控/飞行器一起从 Erle-Brain 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:116
#: 4057b4a1875b480e8ca312bd71285b97
msgid "Bluetooth dongle"
msgstr "蓝牙接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:118
#: 715d5299caf74fa9911bfa2a41289311
msgid ""
"Use a Bluetooth dongle to connect additional devices, such as joysticks."
msgstr "使用蓝牙接收器连接其他设备，例如游戏手柄。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:122
#: 3ebab4c4e394444093dc49a8ff98caf7
msgid "You will need to configure BlueTooth interface to make it work"
msgstr "您需要配置蓝牙接口才能使其正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:128
#: d3e8430228b64c9eb31686a330191ddf
msgid "Connect other peripherals"
msgstr "连接其他外设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:130
#: ad28f07346f04309b8729b587c720e61
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware there may be any number of other peripherals "
"attached, including sensors, cameras, grippers etc. These can be found as "
"sub-pages of the topic :ref:`Optional Hardware <common-optional-hardware>`."
msgstr ""
"根据您的硬件，可能还需要连接其他外设，包括传感器、摄像头、抓手等。这些内容可在 :ref:`可选硬件 <common-optional-"
"hardware>` 主题的子页面中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:134
#: f68872fb40c945de912964bf63e62559
msgid ""
"More information in `official documentation "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 `官方文档 "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:137
#: 5ccb04b1e7c047938316e665f72d7108
msgid "Related information"
msgstr "相关信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:139
#: ca1b964bd234486d8771e593c2575e4d
msgid ""
"`Erle Robotics official documentation <http://docs.erlerobotics.com/>`__ "
"includes additional information about how to use Erle-Brain2."
msgstr ""
"`Erle Robotics 官方文档 <http://docs.erlerobotics.com/>`__ 包含有关如何使用 Erle-Brain2 "
"的更多信息。"

